&#x0D;
	Engine start was normal.  After beginning taxi roll a slight bump was felt that &#x0D;
	was compatible with a rough ramp area.  During taxi a pack malfunction &#x0D;
	occurred and was eliminated prior to takeoff.&#x0D;
&#x0D;
