According to the operator, the airplane had accumulated 10,821 hours total time in service.  The airplane was being maintained under the provisions of a FAA approved continuous airworthiness program.  The last inspection was completed on May 9, 2005, and the airplane had accumulated 1,204 hours since the inspection.&#x0D;
