At 0853, the recorded weather at MDW was: Wind 210 degrees at 10 knots; visibility 10 statute miles; sky condition few clouds 1,100 feet, scattered 10,000, broken 20,000; temperature 24 degrees C; dew point 22 degrees C; altimeter 29.89 inches of mercury. &#x0D;
