&#x0D;
Airbus issued AMM Temporary Revision No. 32-048 dated December 23, 2003.  The filing instructions for this revision stated, "Insert this Temporary Revision immediately before 32-21-13, Page 425, with the issue date Nov 01/02."   This revision changed the procedures for installing the shock absorber in the airplane by adding the following Note and steps under Section B:&#x0D;
&#x0D;
