Southwest Airlines Co. was certificated as a 49 CFR Part 121 air carrier and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas. At the time of the incident, the company employed nearly 35,000 employees, operating more than 3,400 flights a day serving 72 cities in 37 states. As of March 27, 2011, Southwest Airlines reported 230 daily departures from MDW.&#x0D;
