On May 7, 2010, at 1700 UTC a Boeing 747-400, N128UA, operated by United Airlines, experienced a tailstrike on departure from Sydney, Australia.  The airplane had minor damage and returned to SYD and landed without injuries or futher incident.  &#x0D;
&#x0D;
